### Unisabana Marketplace API - Pruebas
### Usa la extensión REST Client de VS Code para ejecutar estas pruebas

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = 

### ============================================
### AUTENTICACIÓN
### ============================================

### 1. Crear primer admin (solo una vez)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/create-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@unisabana.edu.co",
  "password": "admin123",
  "name": "Administrador"
}

### 2. Registrar usuario 1 (Comprador/Vendedor)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maria.gomez@unisabana.edu.co",
  "password": "password123",
  "name": "María Gómez"
}

### 3. Registrar usuario 2 (Comprador)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carlos.ruiz@unisabana.edu.co",
  "password": "password123",
  "name": "Carlos Ruiz"
}

### 4. Login usuario 1 (Guardar el token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maria.gomez@unisabana.edu.co",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 5. Login usuario 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carlos.ruiz@unisabana.edu.co",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 6. Ver mi perfil
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Convertirse en vendedor
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/become-seller
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### PRODUCTOS
### ============================================

### 8. Publicar producto 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Calculadora Científica Casio",
  "price": 45000,
  "description": "Calculadora en perfecto estado, usada solo un semestre",
  "stock": 1,
  "image": "https://example.com/calculadora.jpg"
}

### 9. Publicar producto 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Libro Cálculo III",
  "price": 80000,
  "description": "Libro de Stewart, 8va edición, como nuevo",
  "stock": 1
}

### 10. Ver todos los productos (sin auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### 11. Ver producto específico
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/PRODUCT_ID_AQUI

### 12. Buscar productos
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?search=calculadora&minPrice=30000&maxPrice=50000

### 13. Actualizar producto
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/PRODUCT_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 40000,
  "description": "Calculadora en perfecto estado - PRECIO REBAJADO"
}

### 14. Eliminar producto (marcar como inactivo)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/PRODUCT_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### CARRITO
### ============================================

### 15. Ver mi carrito
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. Agregar producto al carrito
POST {{baseUrl}}/cart/add
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "PRODUCT_ID_AQUI",
  "quantity": 1
}

### 17. Actualizar cantidad en carrito
PUT {{baseUrl}}/cart/update/ITEM_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 2
}

### 18. Eliminar del carrito
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/cart/remove/ITEM_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 19. Vaciar carrito
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/cart/clear
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### ÓRDENES
### ============================================

### 20. Crear orden desde el carrito
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 21. Ver mis órdenes (compras y ventas)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/my-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 22. Ver orden específica
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/ORDER_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 23. Marcar orden como entregada (vendedor)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/ORDER_ID_AQUI/deliver
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 24. Cancelar orden (comprador)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/ORDER_ID_AQUI/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### CONVERSACIONES Y CHAT
### ============================================

### 25. Crear conversación sobre un producto
POST {{baseUrl}}/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "PRODUCT_ID_AQUI"
}

### 26. Ver todas mis conversaciones
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 27. Ver conversación específica con mensajes
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations/CONVERSATION_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 28. Enviar mensaje en conversación
POST {{baseUrl}}/conversations/CONVERSATION_ID_AQUI/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Hola, ¿el producto está disponible?"
}

### ============================================
### RESEÑAS
### ============================================

### 29. Dejar reseña a vendedor
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sellerId": "SELLER_ID_AQUI",
  "orderId": "ORDER_ID_AQUI",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Excelente vendedor, muy recomendado!"
}

### 30. Ver reseñas de un vendedor
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews?sellerId=SELLER_ID_AQUI

### ============================================
### NOTIFICACIONES
### ============================================

### 31. Ver mis notificaciones
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 32. Marcar notificación como leída
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notifications/NOTIFICATION_ID_AQUI/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 33. Marcar todas como leídas
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### ADMIN
### ============================================

### 34. Ver dashboard (solo admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 35. Ver todos los usuarios (solo admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 36. Ver todos los productos (solo admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 37. Ver todas las órdenes (solo admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 38. Desactivar producto (solo admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/products/PRODUCT_ID_AQUI/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### PRUEBA DE ERRORES
### ============================================

### Intento de registro con email inválido
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "name": "Test User"
}

### Intento de login con credenciales incorrectas
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maria.gomez@unisabana.edu.co",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### Intento de acceder sin token
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart
